1
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:25,850
There may be nights
when there’s no moon in the sky

2
00:00:25,850 --> 00:00:31,716
Days when my heart feels far too tired to try

3
00:00:31,720 --> 00:00:36,276
But somehow time led you into my life

4
00:00:36,280 --> 00:00:43,476
You unlocked the empty space
and let me love you right

5
00:00:43,480 --> 00:00:48,610
Feels just like a dream that I found you

6
00:00:48,610 --> 00:00:53,825
Every second spent with you is so meaningful

7
00:00:53,830 --> 00:00:59,720
The night shines bright, no words could ever do

8
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:02,320
I know that it’s you

9
00:01:02,320 --> 00:01:07,860
The word “love” I say to you, I say it to you

10
00:01:07,860 --> 00:01:12,407
You’re the shining light
when no stars are coming through

11
00:01:12,410 --> 00:01:20,945
You’re the key that found its way to my heart

12
00:01:20,950 --> 00:01:26,000
Let me love you, love you

13
00:01:34,290 --> 00:01:38,880
Every melody in a love song sounds like you

14
